    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BROE auctioneers are delighted to present this charming 3-bedroom mid-terrace family home, complete with a private garden.\r\nThe bright and airy layout includes a porch, an entrance hallway, a living room, and a kitchen/dining room. Upstairs, you will find three bedrooms, along with the main family bathroom. The rear garden features a small block shed and benefits from access via a rear laneway. \r\nLocated just a short stroll from Clondalkin Village, this home is close to various amenities, including shops, schools, and leisure facilities. Additionally, it is only a few minutes drive from the M50, N7, and N4 motorways, providing easy access to all parts of the country. There is also ample off-street parking available at the front of the property. \r\nThis superb home has much to offer, and we recommend scheduling an early viewing. \r\n\r\nContact BROE auctioneers to express your interest."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch \t\t\t\t1.11m x 2.24m \t\tTiled flooring. \t\r\n\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\t           \t4.05m x 1.78m\t\tHardwood flooring.   \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLounge\t\t\t        3.96m x 2.98m  \t \tHardwood flooring, electric fireplace, ceiling coving and TV point.  \r\n                       \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room\t3.24m x 5.94m \t\tRange of floor and eye level units to include \r\nappliances.  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom (1)\t\t\t2.67m x 3.98m\t\tWith built in wardrobes and wood flooring.\r\n  \r\n                                                \r\n\r\nBedroom (2)\t\t\t2.35m x 3.43m\t\tWith built in wardrobes and wood flooring.\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom (3)\t\t\t2.99m x 2.32m\t\tWith built in wardrobes and wood flooring.\r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom\t\t\t2.31m x 1.85m\t           Fully tiled to include WC, WHB & corner shower. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nGarden\t\t\t9.13m x 5.81m              \tGarden to include small shed and rear laneway access. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nNote: 1. These particulars do not constitute an offer or contract or any part thereof and none of the statements contained in the particulars as to the property is to be relied upon as a statement of representation of fact. 2. The Vendor does not make or give, nor is Noel Broe & Sons Ltd T/A Broe Auctioneers or its staff authorized to make or give any representation or warranty in respect of this property. 3. All descriptions, dimensions, references to condition and necessary permission for use and occupation, and other details are given in good faith and are believed to be correct but any intending purchaser should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy himself/herself by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them. 4. In the event of any inconsistency between these particulars and contract of sale the latter shall prevail. We do not hold ourselves responsible for an expense incurred in inspecting this property should it not be suitable, already let, sold or withdrawn from sale. Directors: J. Broe, C. Leap. Registered in Ireland No. 53273"
      },
